@startuml
title Dispatch - atomic booking vs proposed physical warehouse stock
actor Coordinator
actor Carrier
participant "Web UI" as UI
participant "Booking API" as API
participant "Dispatch Service" as Dispatch
database PostgreSQL as DB
participant "Warehouse Ledger (SRS proposed)" as WH
Coordinator -> UI: Select standby vehicle, zone and time slot
UI -> API: POST /standby-fleet/{standbyId}/assign (COORDINATOR)
API -> Dispatch: Validate role, quota, plate, need deficit
Dispatch -> DB: SELECT FOR UPDATE slot and need lines
Dispatch -> DB: Create CONFIRMED shipment + reservations atomically
DB --> Dispatch: Commit / rollback all on 409
opt SRS physical warehouse extension
Dispatch -> WH: Reserve physical stock by batch
WH --> Dispatch: Reservation recorded, on_hand unchanged
end
Dispatch --> API: 201 BookingReceipt
API --> UI: CONFIRMED shipment
Coordinator -> WH: Authorize physical pick and loading
WH -> DB: Atomically decrement on_hand and consume stock reserve
Carrier -> UI: Confirm loaded vehicle departure
UI -> API: PATCH /shipments/{shipmentId}/status (CARRIER)
API -> DB: Transition CONFIRMED -> IN_TRANSIT + audit
@enduml
